Thank you for testing this early version.

This is an alpha: it plays, but things will change, and some things will
break. Please keep a copy of your setlists.

Windows may say "Windows protected your PC" when you start the installer:
this version is not signed yet. Choose "More info", then "Run anyway".

Something went wrong, or have an idea? Please tell us on the project's
GitHub page (Issues). If the app closed unexpectedly, attach the crash
report it names the next time it starts, and the log from the folder
below. A crash report holds part of what the app was working on at the
time (your setlist's text, plugin names): look before you send it.
The log is in:

  %LOCALAPPDATA%\@PRODUCT_ORGANIZATION@\@PRODUCT_NAME@\logs

Your settings, setlists and plugin list stay when you install a newer
version, and when you uninstall.
